{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "logos-webposto-cockpit-2026",
    "name": "Logos · WebPosto Cockpit (Quality + Gateway)",
    "description": "Use no Cursor com a extensão Postman (Postman.postman-for-vscode).\n\n**Importar:** Import → Folder → `postman/` + Import → `.env` → `.env` raiz\n**Environment:** Logos · Local\n\n**O que dá para fazer aqui:**\n- Testar API Quality e gateway sem abrir o browser\n- Rodar pasta inteira (Collection Runner)\n- Scripts de teste (status, JSON, posto identificado)\n- Proxy POST igual ao dashboard operacional\n- Gerar código curl/JS a partir de qualquer request\n- Sincronizar variáveis com `.env` automaticamente",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const k = pm.environment.get('WEBPOSTO_API_KEY');",
          "if (k && !pm.environment.get('CHAVE')) { pm.environment.set('CHAVE', k); }",
          "const u = pm.environment.get('WEBPOSTO_BASE_URL');",
          "if (u) { pm.environment.set('base_url', u); }",
          "const p = pm.environment.get('API_PORT') || '8000';",
          "pm.environment.set('gateway_url', 'http://127.0.0.1:' + p);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://web.qualityautomacao.com.br" },
    { "key": "CHAVE", "value": "" },
    { "key": "gateway_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000" },
    { "key": "data_inicial", "value": "2026-05-01" },
    { "key": "data_final", "value": "2026-05-16" },
    { "key": "grupos_exemplo", "value": "24554,24555" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Checklist rápido (rodar pasta inteira)",
      "description": "Clique direito na pasta → Run. Valida chave, posto e gateway antes do dashboard.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 Gateway health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Gateway online', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('JSON healthy', () => { const j = pm.response.json(); pm.expect(j.status).to.eql('healthy'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/health" }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 Chave WebPosto (EMPRESAS)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('CHAVE válida (200)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const rows = Array.isArray(body) ? body : (body.resultados || []);",
                  "pm.test('Posto identificado', () => pm.expect(rows.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "if (rows[0]) {",
                  "  const f = rows[0].fantasia || rows[0].nomeFantasia || '';",
                  "  pm.environment.set('posto_fantasia', f);",
                  "  console.log('Posto:', f);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/INTEGRACAO/EMPRESAS?CHAVE={{CHAVE}}",
              "query": [{ "key": "CHAVE", "value": "{{CHAVE}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03 Grupos no gateway",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Grupos OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Mais de 9 grupos no cadastro', () => pm.expect(j.total_grupos_sistema || j.total_grupos).to.be.above(9));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{gateway_url}}/api/v1/webposto/grupos-produto" }
        },
        {
          "name": "04 Adelaide metrics (dados reais)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Métricas 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Dados reais confirmados', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.status_api).to.eql('dados_reais_live');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.fallback).to.eql(false);",
                  "  pm.expect(j.dados_reais).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway_url}}/api/v1/adelaide/metrics?periodo=mensal",
              "query": [{ "key": "periodo", "value": "mensal" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
